Some Notes:

1.we need a class that store our key/value pairs.
  so we create KeyValuePaid class. (we need to store the key
                                    so we can find the right pair when we have collisions)

2.we use a simple Hash Function:
  key % size
  but we can use Java HashCode as Hash Function.

3.we use chaining for collisions
  (use linked-list for collisions)
  LinkedList<KeyValuePair>

